  @invariant  grid.chanFirst/Last/lane1Col are chan-keyed; numRows is int  @ 16
  @invariant  selection part names: pitch/vel/delay on note; pb on pb; val on scalar  @ 22
  @contract  resolves same-onset plan collisions in a per-column plan list (mutates in place)  @ 314
  @invariant  fromLogical is monotone but not isotone; two logical onsets can round onto one raw ppq  @ 315
  @contract  later-source-ppq plan (curr by tie-break) shifts up 1 ppq, else predecessor shifts back  @ 316
